 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zDbR2Aze4z8Q7kNvwFhDo_M&_nc_oc=Adoc33K54isVyJOTk_3qU5iVr_KqRP6a-lH2jnjNWZPFNHyCikBxYvW7gBGNYZpDjfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHFao0ZONRjiJlSBa-d2lOvGMLLwUGk_N7VECGFdcEZg&oe=6B047363"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PzrAEMboQTMQ7kNvwGO2Ecu&_nc_oc=Adp39bFfNajQz7Rlc3I-QAh2gWrlMe7n0u9K3vGGxTPUBiWse8Q_8Dv6ohu0tXVqM6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNA10yiVBWNPfmorWpdIIlMMqfPs5MRSq1tHXlI4qisw&oe=6B045F5D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xj7KtnlfgCoQ7kNvwG-mxpz&_nc_oc=AdpDWw2jUxkzTl6VacllZTqfM1uHPr1hI_xmhp3b7IQUP24FL7GlS_KHQCRzTlGIBo4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYzN3dT04Ze_pwYhM7zl6FHP